              "heading": "ZX Bank Ltd. – Branch Network in Jaipur"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank Ltd. maintains a robust banking presence across Jaipur, providing comprehensive financial services through an extensive branch distribution. With dedicated branches in North, South, East, West, and Central Jaipur, customers can conveniently access retail banking, digital services, loans, and wealth management close to their neighborhoods. This regional network ensures financial inclusion and customer support throughout all major zones of the city."
